        <h4>📚 Course: Physics</h4>
        <p>This queue shows all submissions for Physics course assignments, quizzes, and assessments.</p>
        <p>Submissions are processed automatically and students receive feedback through the affect detection system.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div id="queueList">
        <div class="empty-queue">
            <h3>📥 No submissions in queue</h3>
            <p>Physics quiz submissions will appear here when students submit their answers.</p>
